##
# @USBUplinkType:
#
# The backend an emulated USB device is uplinked to.
#
# @inferno: the Inferno USB Uplink host controller, which connects out to
#     a remote.
#
# @virtualhere: a VirtualHere-protocol server, which exports the device
#     to clients that connect in.
#
# @net: an in-process USB host that switches an Apple device to its
